.fontmarkers short
.contents 2
.h1 Quarterly report
This report describes the work of the third quarter and the plan for the
fourth.  It is divided into three parts, and each part into short sections so
that a reader can see the shape of the whole by looking at the headlines.

.h1 Results
The quarter ended with all the main goals met.  The details follow.
.h2 Sales
Sales grew by eleven percent over the second quarter.  The growth came mostly
from the two new regions that opened in July.
.h3 By region
The north grew fastest.  The south was flat.
.h3 By product
The new line sold better than expected and the old line sold less.
.h2 Costs
Costs grew by four percent, less than the sales.
.h2 People
Three people joined and one left.

.h1 Plan
The plan for the fourth quarter has four items.
.h2 Goals
Keep the growth, hold the costs, and open one more region.
.h2 Schedule
The work starts in October and ends in December.
.h2 Risks
A late delivery of the new line is the main risk.

.h1 Appendix
The tables of figures are kept in a separate document.
